        "salience_rank": 1
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The grid guardians moved to restore order on the frontline of the power crisis. When the critical system failure of a key power plant component struck, they raised the alarm with a high-level warning and initiated operational procedures to avoid overload, confronting the challenge of increased electricity consumption due to high temperatures.",
